| item | setting |
|---|---|
| architecture | DSparkDraftModel, block_size 16, 5 layers (all full attention), hidden 4096, 32 heads / 8 KV heads (GQA), head_dim 128 |
| MoE FFN | 8 routed SwiGLU experts of width 4096, top-1 softmax routing without top-k renormalisation (`num_experts_per_tok` 1, `norm_topk_prob` false), 1 sigmoid-gated shared expert of width 2048, router centering `sample` (momentum 0.99), auxiliary balance loss 0.001, `grouped_mm` dispatch, preset `qwen3_5_moe` |
| target feature layers | 1, 9, 17, 25, 33 |
| Markov head / confidence head | vanilla, rank 256 / off |
| projector / mask_token_id | dspark / 151669 |
| rope_theta / max_position_embeddings | 1e6 / 40960 |
| vocab | 151936, untied; frozen target embedding (`model.embed_tokens.weight`) |
| size | about 2.4B parameters, about 0.7B active per token |

### Training (the dense recipe, applied unchanged unless listed under deviations)

| item | setting |
|---|---|
| strategy | dspark, online disaggregated capture (Mooncake TCP) |
| epochs / optimizer steps | 12 in one run / 129,168 (estimate (num_epochs x epoch_steps)) |
| global batch | 132 = batch_size 2 x accumulation_steps 11 x 6 DDP ranks |
| optimizer | AdamW, lr 6e-4, cosine over the whole run, warmup 4%, FP32 master params |
| max_grad_norm | 1.0 |
| num_anchors / loss_decay_gamma / objective_chunk_blocks | 512 / 7.0 / 128 |
| loss | 0.1 CE + 0.9 L1, confidence loss 0 |
| sharding / precision / attention | NO_SHARD (DDP) / bf16 + Liger kernels / flex_attention |
| checkpoints | every 2691 steps, newest 8 kept by the trainer; epoch k = step k x 10,764 (copied out of the rotation, exported, uploaded) |
| seed / prompt_seed | 42 / 42 |
| hardware | 1 node x 8 H200: capture servers on GPUs 0-1, trainer ranks on GPUs 2-7 |

### Deviations from the dense run

- Global batch 132 instead of 128: 128 does not divide over 6 trainer ranks, and 132 is this branch's standard for the 2-server + 6-rank layout.
- 12 epochs in one run with one cosine schedule (the dense run planned 6 epochs and stopped at step 40,960).
- Draft attention stays bidirectional inside the block: `is_causal`, `dspark_flatten_projection`, `dspark_cache_projection` and `ddp_bucket_cap_mb` (unmerged PR #942) are not used on this branch.
- The dense FFN (12288) is replaced by the MoE FFN above; every other draft-config field is the dense skeleton.

